ext{ lines}\n  $$\n\nSo, lines from the **first scene**:  \n$$\n36 \\text{ lines}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **3. Second Scene**\n\n- The **second scene** has **six more lines** than the song.\n- The song has **54 lines**, so the **second scene** has:\n  $$\n  54 + 6 = 60 \\text{ lines}\n  $$\n- **Four-fifths** of them are his lines. So:\n  $$\n  \\frac{4}{5} \\times 60 = 48 \\text{ lines}\n  $$\n\nSo, lines from the **second scene**:  \n$$\n48 \\text{ lines}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **4. Total Lines to Memorize**\n\nNow, add the lines from all sources:\n\n- Solo song: $ 54 $\n- First scene: $ 36 $\n- Second scene: $ 48 $\n\n$$\n\\text{Total lines} = 54 + 36 + 48 = \\boxed{138}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{138}\n$$ lines that Sean has to memorize.", "decode_seconds": 11.143324363045394, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 119, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "dcacb2ec9c9a3ebc4ee4e4cca282566213895bd5e061079f584c97ea66c407fc", "output_tokens": 426, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20561935872, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20881342464, "problem_id": "gsm8k/a9798075c6e641a8", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 11177.699495106936}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "138", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 11.177699495106936, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20881342464, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20881342464, "sampling_seed": 1830359572277660469, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 426, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.032918845769017935, "turn_index": 0}
